---
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
import SampleComponent from "@components/SampleComponent.astro";
import Container from "@components/Container.astro";
import AstroLogo from "@assets/images/astro-logo-light-gradient.png";
import { Content as SampleMarkdown } from "@content/sample-markdown.md";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Header from "@components/Header.astro"
import HeaderMobile from "@components/HeaderMobile.astro"
import Footer from "@components/Footer.astro"
---

<Layout title="Graphic Design">
  <Container>

  <Header/>
  <HeaderMobile/>
<div class="h1">
    <h1>Graphic Design</h1>
  </div>
    <div class="content">


<div class="group1">

    <div class="text">
  <h2>Sound Hearing Audiology</h2>
  <p class="year">(2025)</p>
  <p>A comission for the audiology practice: Sound Hearing Audiology. A fairly simple comission, but a really fun collaborative project.</p>
      </div>

      <div class=image>
  <img src="/img/sound hearing audiology.png" alt="Sound Hearing Audiology logo" />
</div></div>

<div class="group">
    <div class="text">
  <h2>Landline Presents Posters</h2>
  <p class="year">(2025)</p>
  <p>A series of comission pieces from Landline Presents, a local house show venue who hosted a few shows in my neighborhood.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="image">
      <img src="/img/LandLinePoster1.png" alt="Landline Poster Number 1"/>
      <img src="/img/LandLinePoster2.png" alt="Landline Poster Number 2"/>
</div>
</div>
<div class="group">
    <div class="text">    
  <h2>Lost Media Research Project</h2>
  <p class="year">(2025)</p>
  <p>A research project about lost media; this is one of the most elaborate projects I've ever worked on.</p><p>In the future I'm hoping to create a seperate page here going more in depth on the process behind this piece.</p>
    </div>

  
    <div class="image">
  <img src="/img/Lost Media Front.png" alt="Front Side of Lost Media Poster, the image resembles that of an old movie poster."/>
  <img src="/img/Lost Media Back.png" alt="Back Side of Lost Media Poster, this side includes statistics for who knows about lost media and reccomendations for where to find Lost Media"/>
    </div>
 </div>

<div class="group">
    <div class="text">
  <h2>Gameboy Camera Pros and Cons</h2>
      
  <p class="year">(2025)</p>
  <p>A class project that I mainly used as an excuse to do some really fun visuals revolving around a gameboy camera I aquired around the time. It was a really nice opertunity to merge my design work with some of my more casual photography.</p>
      </div>


    <div class="image">
  <img src="/img/gbcamera.jpg" alt="Poster going over the pros and cons of using a gameboy camera."/>
      </div>
</div>


<div class="group">

    <div class="text">
  <h2>Tasty Pictures Business Card</h2>
  <p class="year">(2025)</p>
  <p>The front and back to the business cards I made for my film group, one of my favorite personal projects that I've done in recent memory.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="imagev">
  <img src="/img/tastypicfront.png" alt="Tasty Pictures Business Card front"/>
  <img src="/img/tastypicback.png" alt="Tasty Pictures Business Card back"/>
      </div>

</div>

<div class="group">
    <div class="text">
  <h2>Design Manifesto</h2>
  <p class="year">(2024)</p>
  <p>My Design Manifesto was my final project for my Design Theory and Criticism class. This project went over how I felt at the time moving from creative endevors to more comission based design work. And while now I have more outlets to express that original creative work, this piece still shows how mindsets need to adapt from project to project.</p>
  <p class="project-link"><a href="/img/manifesto.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Design Manifesto PDF</a></p>
    </div>

    <div class="pdf">
  <img src="/img/manifesto.webp" data-pdf-link="/img/manifesto.pdf" alt="Design Manifesto project">
    </div>

  </div>

<div class="group">
    <div class="text">
  <h2>Alan Bell Research Magazine</h2>
  <p class="year">(2024)</p>
  <p>A variation of a project I did in my sophmore year Design Theory and Criticism class. For the project we had to make the paper in a more minimalist style, but on the side I wanted to make this version that was heavily inspired by Bell's work in the design field. Focusing on his formatting and image placements in BLK magazine.</p>
  <p class="project-link"><a href="/img/Alan Bell project.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Alan Bell Research Magazine PDF</a></p>
    </div>


    <div class="pdf">
  <img src="/img/Alan Bell.webp" data-pdf-link="/img/Alan Bell project.pdf" alt="Alan Bell resarch project article">
    </div>
</div>


<div class="group">
    <div class="text">
  <h2>The Economical</h2>
  <p class="year">(2024)</p>
  <p>While this project feels simple compared to my more recent work, This was certainly the project that helped me grasp magazine formatting in ways I hadn't in the past.
  Sometime in the near future I would love to fix up the font scaling on this project and bring in some more legability to the final product.</p>
  <p class="project-link"><a href="/img/TheEconomical.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">The Economical PDF</a></p>
    </div>

    <div class="pdf">
  <img src="/img/TheEconomical.webp" data-pdf-link="/img/TheEconomical.pdf" alt="The Economical Article">
      </div>
</div>


<div class="group">
    <div class="text">
  <h2>Ǧ</h2>
  <p class="year">(2024)</p>
  <p>This project was to create a band based off a random prompt for both the band name and album title. I put this project here as it is a more recent example of my surreal collage work. When I first got into design, the medium that grabbed my attention before any other was surreal collage. So by having this project here I feel it defines how my roots got me to where I am now.</p>
      </div>

  <div class="imagev">
  <img src="/img/g front.jpg" alt="Ǧ album cover front"/>
  <img src="/img/g inside.jpg" alt="Ǧ album cover inside"/>
  <img src="/img/g back.jpg" alt="Ǧ album cover back"/>
      </div>

</div>

</div>

<div class="lightbox" id="gd-lightbox" aria-hidden="true">
  <button class="lightbox-close" type="button" aria-label="Close image viewer">
    <img src="/img/nav/x.webp" alt="close image viewer" />
  </button>
  <button class="lightbox-nav lightbox-prev" type="button" aria-label="Previous image">
    <img src="/img/reusable/arrow.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
  </button>
  <div class="lightbox-stage">
    <img class="lightbox-image" src="" alt="" />
  </div>
  <button class="lightbox-nav lightbox-next" type="button" aria-label="Next image">
    <img src="/img/reusable/arrow.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
  </button>
  <div class="lightbox-info" aria-live="polite">
    <h2 class="lightbox-title"></h2>
    <p class="lightbox-year"></p>
    <p class="lightbox-description"></p>
    <p class="lightbox-link-hint">
      <a class="lightbox-link" href="" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"></a>
    </p>
    <p class="lightbox-count"></p>
  </div>
</div>

  <Footer/>

  </Container>
  </Layout>

  <style>
    .h1{
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column; 
        align-items: center;
    }
.content{
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        flex-direction: column; 
        align-items: center;
}

.group1{
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: row;
      padding-bottom: 50px;
      width: 1200px;
    }

    .group{
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: row;
      padding-top:50px;
      padding-bottom: 50px;
      border-top: .1rem solid black;
      width: 1200px;
    }
    .text{
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      width: 600px;
      padding: 10px;
      padding-right: 15px
    }
    .text h2{
      margin-bottom: 1px;
      
    line-height: 1.25;
    }
    .text .year{
      margin-top: 0;
      font-weight: 400;
      font-size: 0.92em;
    }
    .text p{
      margin-top: 0;
      padding-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .project-link{
      padding-top: 10px;
      margin-top: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 0;
      font-size: 0.92em;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .project-link a{
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 2px;
    }
    .image{
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      width: 600px;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .image img{
      object-fit: contain;
      padding: 10px;
      padding-left: 15px;
      cursor: zoom-in;
      transition: filter 280ms ease;
    }
      .imagev{
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      max-width: 600px;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-left: 100px;
    }
    .imagev img{
      object-fit: contain;
      padding: 10px;
      padding-left: 15px;
      cursor: zoom-in;
      transition: filter 280ms ease;

  filter: drop-shadow(0px 0px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1));
    }
     .pdf{
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      width: 600px;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .pdf img{
      object-fit: contain;
      padding: 10px;
padding-left: 15px;
      max-width:450px;
      margin-left: 0;
      cursor: zoom-in;
      
  filter: drop-shadow(-10px 10px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15));
  transition: filter 280ms ease;
    }

    .image img:hover,
    .image img:focus-visible{
      filter: brightness(0.7);
    }

    .image img:active,
    .image img:focus-visible:active{
      filter: brightness(0.6);
    }

    .imagev img:hover,
    .imagev img:focus-visible{
      filter: drop-shadow(0px 0px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)) brightness(0.7);
    }

    .imagev img:active,
    .imagev img:focus-visible:active{
      filter: drop-shadow(0px 0px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)) brightness(0.6);
    }

    .pdf img:hover,
    .pdf img:focus-visible{
      filter: drop-shadow(-10px 10px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15)) brightness(0.7);
    }

    .pdf img:active,
    .pdf img:focus-visible:active{
      filter: drop-shadow(-10px 10px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15)) brightness(0.6);
    }

    .lightbox{
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      display: none;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      grid-template-rows: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
      align-items: stretch;
      justify-items: stretch;
      background: transparent;
      overflow: hidden;
      z-index: 1000;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .lightbox::before,
    .lightbox::after{
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .lightbox::before{
      background-image: url('/img/nav/crumpled.jpg');
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
      opacity: 0.85;
      z-index: 0;
    }

    .lightbox::after{
      background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15)), linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15));
      z-index: 0;
    }

    .lightbox-stage,
    .lightbox-info{
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .lightbox.open{
      display: grid;
    }

    .lightbox-stage{
      grid-row: 1;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      min-height: 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .lightbox-image{
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      max-width: min(1500px, calc(100vw - 180px));
      max-height: calc(100% - 84px);
      object-fit: contain;
      margin-top: 56px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      transition: transform 180ms ease, opacity 180ms ease;
      will-change: transform, opacity;
    }

    .lightbox-close{
      position: fixed;
      top: 22px;
      right: 22px;
      border: none;
      background: none;
      padding: 0;
      cursor: pointer;
      z-index: 5;
    }

    .lightbox-close img{
      width: 30px;
      height: auto;
      display: block;
      transition: opacity 180ms ease;
    }

    .lightbox-close:hover img,
    .lightbox-close:focus-visible img{
      opacity: 0.55;
    }

    .lightbox-close:active img,
    .lightbox-close:focus-visible:active img{
      opacity: 0.4;
    }

    .lightbox-nav{
      position: fixed;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      border: 0;
      background: none;
      color: white;
      width: auto;
      height: auto;
      padding: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
      z-index: 5;
    }

    .lightbox-nav img{
      width: 22px;
      height: auto;
      display: block;
      margin: 0 auto;
      transform: rotate(5deg);
      transition: opacity 180ms ease;
    }

    .lightbox-nav:hover img,
    .lightbox-nav:focus-visible img{
      opacity: 0.55;
    }

    .lightbox-nav:active img,
    .lightbox-nav:focus-visible:active img{
      opacity: 0.4;
    }

    .lightbox-prev img{
      transform: rotate(185deg);
    }

    .lightbox-prev{
      left: 20px;
    }

    .lightbox-next{
      right: 20px;
    }

    .lightbox-info{
      grid-row: 2;
      color: #111111;
      background: #FAF6B1;
      box-shadow: -10px 10px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
      width: min(1100px, calc(100vw - 40px));
      justify-self: center;
      padding: clamp(12px, 2vw, 20px);
      font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 1.2vw, 1rem);
    }

    .lightbox-info > *{
      max-width: none;
      margin-left: 0;
      margin-right: 0;
    }

    .lightbox-title{
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 2px;
      color: #111111;
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.1vw, 1.4rem);
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .lightbox-year{
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: clamp(0.8rem, 1.2vw, 0.95rem);
    }

    .lightbox-description{
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 1.35vw, 1rem);
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .lightbox-count{
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(0.75rem, 1.05vw, 0.85rem);
      opacity: 0.85;
    }

    .lightbox-link-hint{
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: clamp(0.78rem, 1.1vw, 0.9rem);
      font-style: italic;
      opacity: 0.85;
      display: none;
    }

    .lightbox-link-hint.visible{
      display: block;
    }

    .lightbox-link{
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 2px;
      font-style: normal;
    }

    .lightbox-link:hover,
    .lightbox-link:focus-visible{
      opacity: 0.7;
    }

    .lightbox-link:active,
    .lightbox-link:focus-visible:active{
      opacity: 0.55;
    }

@media (max-width: 1190px){
  .group1, .group{
    flex-direction: column;
    width: 95vw;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .text, .image, .imagev, .pdf, .pdf img{
    width: 100%;
    margin-left:0px;
  }
  .pdf, .pdf img{
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }
  img{
    max-width:600px
  }

  .lightbox-nav{
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
  }
}
@media (max-width: 768px){

    .text .year{
      margin-top: 5px;
    }

  img{
  max-width:100%;
}

  .lightbox-nav{
    display: flex;
    top: 36%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
  }

  .lightbox{
    padding: 12px;
  }

  .lightbox-prev{
    left: 12px;
  }

  .lightbox-next{
    right: 12px;
  }

  .lightbox-info{
    width: calc(100vw - 24px);
    padding: 12px;
  }

  .lightbox-image{
    max-width: calc(100vw - 124px);
    max-height: calc(100% - 76px);
    margin-top: 48px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
}
  </style>

<script>
  /** @type {HTMLElement | null} */
  const lightbox = document.getElementById("gd-lightbox");
  /** @type {HTMLElement | null} */
  const lightboxStage = lightbox?.querySelector(".lightbox-stage") ?? null;
  const lightboxImage = lightbox?.querySelector(".lightbox-image") as HTMLImageElement | null;
  /** @type {HTMLElement | null} */
  const lightboxTitle = lightbox?.querySelector(".lightbox-title") ?? null;
  /** @type {HTMLElement | null} */
  const lightboxYear = lightbox?.querySelector(".lightbox-year") ?? null;
  /** @type {HTMLElement | null} */
  const lightboxDescription = lightbox?.querySelector(".lightbox-description") ?? null;
  /** @type {HTMLElement | null} */
  const lightboxLinkHint = lightbox?.querySelector(".lightbox-link-hint") ?? null;
  const lightboxLink = lightbox?.querySelector(".lightbox-link") as HTMLAnchorElement | null;
  /** @type {HTMLElement | null} */
  const lightboxCount = lightbox?.querySelector(".lightbox-count") ?? null;
  const closeButton = lightbox?.querySelector(".lightbox-close") as HTMLButtonElement | null;
  const prevButton = lightbox?.querySelector(".lightbox-prev") as HTMLButtonElement | null;
  const nextButton = lightbox?.querySelector(".lightbox-next") as HTMLButtonElement | null;

  const clickableImages = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(".group1 img, .group img"));

  const itemElements = Array.from(new Set(clickableImages.map((img) => img.closest(".group1, .group")).filter(Boolean)));
  const itemIndexByElement = new Map(itemElements.map((element, index) => [element, index + 1]));
  const totalItems = itemElements.length;

  const slides = clickableImages.map((img) => {
    const project = img.closest(".group1, .group");
    const title = project?.querySelector(".text h2")?.textContent?.trim() ?? "";
    const year = project?.querySelector(".text .year")?.textContent?.trim() ?? "";
    const description = project?.querySelector(".text p:not(.year)")?.textContent?.trim() ?? "";
    const linkInDescription = project?.querySelector(".project-link a")?.getAttribute("href") ?? "";

    return {
      src: img.getAttribute("src") ?? "",
      alt: img.getAttribute("alt") ?? "",
      title,
      year,
      description,
      link: img.getAttribute("data-pdf-link") ?? img.closest("a")?.getAttribute("href") ?? linkInDescription,
      itemIndex: project ? (itemIndexByElement.get(project) ?? 0) : 0,
    };
  });

  let currentIndex = 0;
  let touchStartX = 0;
  let touchStartY = 0;
  let isAnimatingSwipe = false;

  const updateNavVisibility = () => {
    if (!prevButton || !nextButton || !slides.length) {
      return;
    }

    prevButton.style.visibility = currentIndex === 0 ? "hidden" : "visible";
    nextButton.style.visibility = currentIndex === slides.length - 1 ? "hidden" : "visible";
  };

  const renderSlide = (index: number) => {
    if (!slides.length || !lightbox || !lightboxImage || !lightboxTitle || !lightboxYear || !lightboxDescription || !lightboxCount || !lightboxLinkHint || !lightboxLink) {
      return;
    }

    currentIndex = Math.max(0, Math.min(index, slides.length - 1));
    const slide = slides[currentIndex];

    lightboxImage.src = slide.src;
    lightboxImage.alt = slide.alt;
    lightboxTitle.textContent = slide.title;
    lightboxYear.textContent = slide.year;
    lightboxDescription.textContent = slide.description;
    const linkText = `${slide.title || "Project"} PDF`;
    lightboxLink.textContent = slide.link ? linkText : "";
    lightboxLink.href = slide.link || "";
    lightboxLinkHint.classList.toggle("visible", Boolean(slide.link));
    lightboxCount.textContent = `${slide.itemIndex} / ${totalItems}`;
    lightboxImage.style.cursor = "default";
    updateNavVisibility();
  };

  const animateSwipeToSlide = (nextIndex: number, direction: number) => {
    if (!lightboxImage || isAnimatingSwipe) {
      return;
    }

    const clampedIndex = Math.max(0, Math.min(nextIndex, slides.length - 1));
    if (clampedIndex === currentIndex) {
      return;
    }

    isAnimatingSwipe = true;
    const exitOffset = direction > 0 ? -56 : 56;
    const enterOffset = -exitOffset;

    lightboxImage.style.transform = `translateX(${exitOffset}px)`;
    lightboxImage.style.opacity = "0";

    window.setTimeout(() => {
      renderSlide(clampedIndex);

      lightboxImage.style.transition = "none";
      lightboxImage.style.transform = `translateX(${enterOffset}px)`;
      lightboxImage.style.opacity = "0";
      void lightboxImage.offsetWidth;

      lightboxImage.style.transition = "transform 180ms ease, opacity 180ms ease";
      lightboxImage.style.transform = "translateX(0)";
      lightboxImage.style.opacity = "1";

      window.setTimeout(() => {
        isAnimatingSwipe = false;
      }, 190);
    }, 180);
  };

  const openLightbox = (index: number) => {
    if (!lightbox) return;

    renderSlide(index);
    if (lightboxImage) {
      lightboxImage.style.transform = "translateX(0)";
      lightboxImage.style.opacity = "1";
    }
    lightbox.classList.add("open");
    lightbox.setAttribute("aria-hidden", "false");
    document.body.style.overflow = "hidden";
  };

  const closeLightbox = () => {
    if (!lightbox) return;

    lightbox.classList.remove("open");
    lightbox.setAttribute("aria-hidden", "true");
    document.body.style.overflow = "";
  };

  clickableImages.forEach((img, index) => {
    img.addEventListener("click", (event) => {
      event.preventDefault();
      openLightbox(index);
    });
  });

  prevButton?.addEventListener("click", () => renderSlide(currentIndex - 1));
  nextButton?.addEventListener("click", () => renderSlide(currentIndex + 1));
  closeButton?.addEventListener("click", closeLightbox);

  lightboxStage?.addEventListener("touchstart", (event: Event) => {
    const touch = (event as any).changedTouches?.[0];
    if (!touch) return;
    touchStartX = touch.clientX;
    touchStartY = touch.clientY;
  }, { passive: true });

  lightboxStage?.addEventListener("touchend", (event: Event) => {
    const touch = (event as any).changedTouches?.[0];
    if (!touch) return;
    const deltaX = touch.clientX - touchStartX;
    const deltaY = touch.clientY - touchStartY;

    // Treat as swipe only when mostly horizontal and intentional.
    if (Math.abs(deltaX) > 40 && Math.abs(deltaX) > Math.abs(deltaY)) {
      if (deltaX < 0) {
        animateSwipeToSlide(currentIndex + 1, 1);
      } else {
        animateSwipeToSlide(currentIndex - 1, -1);
      }
    }
  }, { passive: true });

  // Prevent info panel from acting as a link
  const lightboxInfo = lightbox?.querySelector('.lightbox-info');
  lightboxInfo?.addEventListener("click", (event) => {
    event.stopPropagation();
  });

  document.addEventListener("keydown", (event) => {
    if (!lightbox?.classList.contains("open")) {
      return;
    }

    if (event.key === "Escape") {
      closeLightbox();
    }

    if (event.key === "ArrowRight") {
      renderSlide(currentIndex + 1);
    }

    if (event.key === "ArrowLeft") {
      renderSlide(currentIndex - 1);
    }
  });
</script>